{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05302","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得直字 · 李咸","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得直字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳乘令序，四野开晴色。\n日月数初幷，乾坤圣登极。\n菊黄迎酒泛，松翠凌霜直。\n游海难爲深，负山徒倦力。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}